WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:02.000
This is Suzie. I copy.

00:00:02.084 --> 00:00:04.044
-Suzie!
-Dusty-bun?

00:00:04.127 --> 00:00:05.128
"Dusty-bun"?

00:00:05.212 --> 00:00:06.129
Where have you been?

00:00:06.213 --> 00:00:09.383
I'm so, so sorry.
I-- I've been really busy...

00:00:10.092 --> 00:00:12.803
uh, trying to save the world
from Russians and monsters.

00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:14.763
[chuckles] Of course you have.

00:00:14.846 --> 00:00:16.765
Get the goddamn number already!

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:18.392
Who was that?

00:00:18.475 --> 00:00:19.726
[stammers] It was...

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.980
Uh, I don't know, actually.
I think it was just some interference.

00:00:23.063 --> 00:00:24.898
So, why don't we, uh, change frequency

00:00:24.982 --> 00:00:27.442
to 14.158?

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:29.653
Copy that, shifting frequency. Standby.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:32.072
[radio whines]

00:00:34.449 --> 00:00:35.826
[panting]

00:00:39.496 --> 00:00:41.915
-[Suzie] Dusty-bun, you copy?
-[Dustin] I copy, Suzie-poo.

00:00:41.999 --> 00:00:43.709
It sounds much better now, thanks.

00:00:44.126 --> 00:00:45.544
-[both] Suzie.
-Okay, so, listen,

00:00:45.627 --> 00:00:47.087
do you know Planck's constant?

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.922
Do you know the Earth orbits the sun?

00:00:49.006 --> 00:00:53.093
[snickers] Okay, so I know it starts
with two sixes, and then a...

00:00:53.176 --> 00:00:54.302
W-What is it?

00:00:54.386 --> 00:00:57.806
Okay, let me just be clear on this.
I haven't heard from you in a week,

00:00:57.889 --> 00:01:01.268
and now you want a mathematical equation
that you should know

00:01:01.351 --> 00:01:03.353
so you can... save the world?

00:01:03.437 --> 00:01:04.563
Suzie-poo, I promise,

00:01:04.646 --> 00:01:06.481
I will make it up to you
as soon as possible.

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:08.400
You can make it up to me now.

00:01:08.483 --> 00:01:10.861
-What?
-I want to hear it.

00:01:11.778 --> 00:01:14.197
-Not right now.
-Yes, now, Dusty-bun.

00:01:14.281 --> 00:01:16.033
Suzie-poo, this is urgent.

00:01:16.116 --> 00:01:19.161
Yes, yes, you're saving the world,
I heard you the first time,

00:01:19.244 --> 00:01:22.122
but Ged is also saving Earthsea
and he's about to confront the shadow,

00:01:22.205 --> 00:01:24.041
so this is Suzie, signing off.

00:01:24.124 --> 00:01:25.208
Wait, wait, wait! Okay.

00:01:25.292 --> 00:01:26.877
Okay. Okay.

00:01:28.045 --> 00:01:29.254
Shit.

00:01:30.839 --> 00:01:31.757
[sighs]

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:35.552
♪ Turn around ♪

00:01:36.261 --> 00:01:40.974
♪ Look at what you see ♪

00:01:41.516 --> 00:01:43.268
♪ In her face ♪

00:01:43.685 --> 00:01:47.939
-♪ The mirror of your dreams ♪
-[synth music playing]

00:01:48.023 --> 00:01:51.401
[Suzie and Dustin harmonize]
♪ Make believe I'm everywhere ♪

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:54.362
♪ Given in the light ♪

00:01:54.946 --> 00:01:58.033
♪ Written on the pages is ♪

00:01:58.116 --> 00:01:59.743
♪ The answer to ♪

00:01:59.826 --> 00:02:04.206
♪ A never-ending story ♪

00:02:04.748 --> 00:02:07.793
[Suzie and Dustin vocalizing]

00:02:08.668 --> 00:02:10.837
♪ Reach the stars ♪

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:15.717
♪ Fly a fantasy ♪

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:17.594
[singing sounds on radio]
♪ Dream a dream ♪

00:02:18.011 --> 00:02:22.724
♪ And what you see will be ♪

00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:25.769
♪ Rhymes that keep their secrets will ♪

00:02:25.852 --> 00:02:28.939
♪ Unfold behind the clouds ♪

00:02:29.606 --> 00:02:32.984
♪ And there upon a rainbow is ♪

00:02:33.068 --> 00:02:39.574
♪ The answer to a never-ending story ♪

00:02:39.658 --> 00:02:42.994
[Suzie and Dustin vocalizing]

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:46.623
♪ Story ♪

00:02:46.832 --> 00:02:49.960
[Suzie and Dustin vocalizing]

00:02:50.794 --> 00:02:51.628
[chuckles]

00:02:52.337 --> 00:02:56.716
Planck's constant is 6.62607004.

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.468
[panting]

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.265
[keypad beeps]

00:03:08.436 --> 00:03:09.938
You just saved the world.

00:03:10.021 --> 00:03:10.856
[sighs]

00:03:10.939 --> 00:03:12.440
Gosh, I miss you, Dusty-bun.

00:03:12.524 --> 00:03:14.192
And I miss you more, Suzie-poo.

00:03:14.276 --> 00:03:16.945
I miss you more,
multiplied by all the stars in our galaxy.

00:03:17.028 --> 00:03:18.029
[Dustin] No, I miss you--

00:03:18.113 --> 00:03:19.030
Enough.

00:03:20.782 --> 00:03:22.784
[static hissing]

00:03:23.493 --> 00:03:24.316
[ominous synth music playing]

